    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38982" root="مهد" body-key="m">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُهْدٌ</span></b>  <i>Elevated ground</i> or <i>land:</i> (IAar, L, K:)
or <i>depressed and smooth and even ground</i> or <i>land;</i>
(K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُهْدَةٌ</span></b> : (En-Nadr, K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِهَدَةٌ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْهَادٌ</span>: (K:) but the former of these pls. is
doubtful. (TA.)

